<p>Quick tips for New Hope homeowners:</p>

<p><strong>Older home considerations:</strong> If your home predates 1980, your gutters (if original) are past retirement age. Even if they look okay, seams are likely failing, hangers are loosening, and hidden fascia damage may be developing.</p>

<p><strong>Terrain awareness:</strong> New Hope has more grade variation than typical Huntsville suburbs. After heavy rain, walk your property:
<ul>
<li>Where does water flow?</li>
<li>Where does it pool?</li>
<li>Is it getting far enough from your foundation?</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Tree debris reality:</strong> Eastern Madison County has heavy tree coverage. Options:</p>
